<title>UK: Brent Intl signs supply deal with Van Leer.</title>
<headline>Brent Intl signs supply deal with Van Leer.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-02-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Brent International Plc said its unit Swale Process signed a five-year, 15 million stg deal to supply coatings to Van Leer Metallized Products, part of Dutch group Royal Packaging Industries Van Leer NV.</p>
</text>
